394
00:50:10,560 --> 00:50:16,080
[SPEAKER_02] Bila je to i doktorica Nada Jurinčić, Lidija Gaj itede bilo ih je.

395
00:50:16,400 --> 00:50:23,760
[SPEAKER_02] Ali gotovo na prstebala druga ruka, nisam 100% siguran.

396
00:50:24,640 --> 00:50:28,400
[SPEAKER_02] Jer ovo ostalo, to je bilo nehumano.

397
00:50:29,040 --> 00:50:30,160
[SPEAKER_02] To je bilo nehumano.

398
